** sch_path: /home/noritsuna/GPS/xschem/tb_mixer.sch
**.subckt tb_mixer
VDD vdd 0 3.3
XB nb pb vdd 0 bias_gen
VLOIP loip 0 pulse(0 2.3 0.000p 40p 40p 278.202p 636.404p)
VLOQP loqp 0 pulse(0 2.3 159.101p 40p 40p 278.202p 636.404p)
VLOIN loin 0 pulse(0 2.3 318.202p 40p 40p 278.202p 636.404p)
VLOQN loqn 0 pulse(0 2.3 477.303p 40p 40p 278.202p 636.404p)
VRFP sp 0 sin(0 ARF 1575.42e6 0 0 0)
VRFN sn 0 sin(0 ARF 1575.42e6 0 0 180)
RSP sp rfp_s 50
RSN sn rfn_s 50
CCP rfp_s rfp 10p
CCN rfn_s rfn 10p
XM rfp rfn loip loin loqp loqn nb ifip ifin ifqp ifqn vdd 0 mixer_iq
